--   1. Number of API changes per period
--   2. Adoption of new versions
--   3. Deprecation notice lead time
--   4. Developer satisfaction with API docs
--   5. Support tickets related to API changes
-- Feature Reference: API06 (API Changelog)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
